            <ArticleTitle>Pulmonary malacoplakia in an immunocompetent girl: a case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>450-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Malacoplakia is an unusual inflammatory condition with distinctive histologic features. Involvement of the lung is quite uncommon and is rarely described in paediatrics. We report on a case of pulmonary malacoplakia in a teenage girl.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>Copyright 2003 Wiley-Liss, Inc.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
